														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2576314">
									

<p>It's a very good start. Now how can we add to it?</p>
<p>Things like:</p>
<ul>
<li>Redaction in containment procedures</li>
<li>Redaction of expletives</li>
<li>Non-metric measurements</li>
<li>Use of the passive voice without good reason</li>
<li>Characterisation in interview logs</li>
<li>Crosslinking</li>
<li>Physical descriptions of humanoids</li>
<li>When to include supplementary documents</li>
</ul>
<p>Could we come up with a kind of moderated collaboration system, whereby users submit suggestions in comments, and staff periodically update the document with the better ones?</p>
<p>Also, I think it's a good idea to separate issues of style from those of grammar, spelling etc. The &quot;Its/It's&quot; issue is punctuation, not formatting.</p>

							</div>

								
