<blockquote>
<p>Could we come up with a kind of moderated collaboration system, whereby users submit suggestions in comments, and staff periodically update the document with the better ones?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>IMO, I think that will be a hassle to maintain. Considering that this is an essay, the views of multiple parties and potentially changing content might confuse readers looking up to this essay for assistance. But that is mostly Randomini's choice.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>Crosslinking</p>
</blockquote>
<p>I do not see it as firmly-placed with the rest of the lot. In recent times, cross-linking is not as taboo as it was in the past (in the name of universe-building, than to make multiple isolated settings). Instead, I feel that there should be an essay on proper cross-linking. I mean, there is already a <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-1703996/how-to-cross-reference">thread</a> that engages the topic&#8230; unless the community wants more on the subject-matter.</p>

