														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2576515">
									

<p>It's an accurate, well-written essay by someone clearly familiar with how to write for the site. It's also destined to be ignored by the audience it's intended to reach, testimonials up thread notwithstanding. Good enough to support, in any event. If it helps a few people, then it was worthwhile.</p>
<p>I don't really think opening this up to others is a good idea. Then it becomes yet another &quot;I contributed&quot; low quality shitpost magnet that needs to be repeatedly pared or curated. I would encourage the author, though, to revisit this from time to time and post updates. Some of the stuff is a little dated (though things come back), and new issues are arising constantly.</p>

